# Session close

When you finish a turn that changed repo files (content, layouts, scripts, config), end the final response with this block. Skip it for pure Q&A with no edits.

```
## Session close
- Fixed: <one line — what shipped or repaired>
- Encode: <rule/skill to update, or "none">
- Open: <issues count, ponytail debt, or "clean">
```

Keep each line one short sentence. "Encode" is `none` unless the same correction happened twice or the user asked to remember something.
